  "Status": "Estado",
  "The Appointment Status Report is a critical feature of the Reports module, offering a clear overview of the status of all appointments. This report helps you track which appointments are confirmed, pending, completed, or canceled. By having a real-time view of appointment statuses, you can efficiently manage your schedule, reduce no-shows, and improve overall appointment management. This report is essential for maintaining a smooth operational flow and ensuring that your services are delivered as planned.": "El Informe de estado de citas es una característica fundamental del módulo Informes, que ofrece una descripción clara del estado de todas las citas. ",
  "The Reports module in BookingGo SaaS is designed to provide comprehensive insights into your business operations, specifically focusing on key metrics and performance indicators. This module allows you to generate detailed reports that help you monitor and analyze various aspects of your service appointments and customer interactions. With its intuitive interface and powerful reporting capabilities, the Reports module empowers you to make data-driven decisions and optimize your business effectively.": "El módulo de Informes de BookingGo SaaS está diseñado para proporcionar información completa sobre sus operaciones comerciales, centrándose específicamente en métricas clave e indicadores de rendimiento. ",
  "The Reports Module of BookingGo SaaS provides detailed analytics and customizable reports tailored for transportation and travel businesses. Gain insights into booking trends, revenue performance, customer demographics, and operational metrics with intuitive visualizations and exportable data formats. Empower your decision-making and optimize business strategies efficiently with the Reports Module.": "El módulo de informes de BookingGo SaaS proporciona análisis detallados e informes personalizables diseñados para empresas de transporte y viajes. ",
  "The Revenue Report is a vital component of the Reports module, providing a comprehensive overview of your business's financial performance. This report details the income generated from appointments, broken down by service type, period, and customer segments. It helps you track your earnings, identify revenue trends, and forecast future financial performance. By analyzing this report, you can make informed decisions about pricing strategies, budget allocations, and growth initiatives, ensuring the financial health and sustainability of your business.": "El Informe de ingresos es un componente vital del módulo de Informes y proporciona una descripción general completa del desempeño financiero de su empresa. ",
  "The Service Appointment Report delves into the specifics of the services provided, offering detailed analysis on the types and frequency of appointments. This report allows you to see which services are most popular, peak booking times, and the overall demand for each service. With this data, you can optimize your service offerings, allocate resources more efficiently, and identify opportunities for expanding your service portfolio to meet customer needs better.": "El Informe de Citas de Servicio profundiza en las particularidades de los servicios prestados, ofreciendo un análisis detallado sobre los tipos y frecuencia de las citas. ",
